Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 17:43:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] vfs: add regression tests for flush dispatch after slice
 ID

Three deterministic in-memory tests covering the full-block dispatch,
partial-block control, and flush error propagation paths.

Assisted-by: DeepSeek <deepseek-v4-pro>
Signed-off-by: Li Lingfeng <a1151488180@gmail.com>
---
 pkg/vfs/writer_flush_test.go | 243 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 243 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 pkg/vfs/writer_flush_test.go

